Project Design Phase Phase
# ComicCraft — Project Design Phase

 The **Design Phase** defines how ComicCraft will look, how users will interact with it, and how the Gemini-powered components will work together.

 ## 1\. Design Objectives

 The design of ComicCraft should be:

 - **Simple** — beginners should be able to create comics without technical knowledge.
- **Interactive** — users should be able to edit and regenerate AI content.
- **Creative** — the interface should encourage experimentation.
- **Consistent** — characters and story elements should remain coherent across panels.
- **AI-assisted** — Gemini should support the creator rather than completely replace their creative decisions.

