 ### Design Phase Outcome

 At the end of the Design Phase, ComicCraft should have a clearly defined **UI structure, user workflow, AI interaction model, data structure, panel editor concept, and overall system architecture**. These designs can then be used as the foundation for the **development/implementation phase**.
